{"about_the_game":"Featuring exclusive artwork that has never before been publicly released, this artbook includes behind-the-scenes concepts, illustrations, models and more from the development of Mars Attracts. With hundreds of curated images, as well as commentary from the game's artists, the artbook reveals the design philosophy of buildings, characters, and menus within the game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >installation</h2>After purchasing and installing the DLC, the PDF artbook will be in the folder &quot;Mars Attracts Artbook&quot; under the root folder where Mars Attracts is installed.<br><br>For example, on Windows , this folder would typically be &quot;C:\\Program Files (x86)\\Steam\\steamapps\\common\\Mars Attracts&quot;.<br><br>If you are unsure where the game is installed, navigate to Mars Attracts in your Steam library, right click and select &quot;Properties &gt; Local Files &gt; Browse local files&quot;.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3888510?t=1757574368","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3888510?t=1757574368","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888510/a4e89cfc95d7ef3b62ed7b09bf7890aa792c3d8d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757574368","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888510/a4e89cfc95d7ef3b62ed7b09bf7890aa792c3d8d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757574368","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77}],"content_d